Solnest SEO/AEO is a fork of Claude SEO v2.2.4. It is not affiliated with,
endorsed by, or supported by the upstream project or its author. Please do not
file Solnest SEO/AEO issues on the upstream tracker.

Modifications made by Solnest AI on top of upstream v2.2.4:

  - scripts/parse_html.py: link analysis was gated behind an optional --url
    flag and reported "0" internal and external links when it was omitted,
    which reads as "this page has no links" rather than "this was not
    measured". It now falls back to the page's own canonical or og:url, and
    reports "not analyzed" when no base URL can be determined.

  - scripts/parse_html.py: text extraction returned decorative content. Split-text
    and scramble animations duplicate every character into aria-hidden="true"
    spans while keeping one clean sr-only copy, so an <h1> reading "Watch what
    happens when AI meets your business." was returned as
    "Watch what happensWWWWaaaattttcccchhhh...". Separately,
    get_text(strip=True) stripped standalone whitespace nodes between inline
    elements, collapsing "Still doing it<!-- --> <span>all yourself?</span>"
    into "Still doing itall yourself?", and block-level spans used as line
    breaks joined without a space. Extraction now skips aria-hidden subtrees,
    treats block-level boundaries as word separators, normalizes whitespace
    across the joined string, and falls back to full text rather than returning
    an empty heading. Applies to titles, headings, link text and word counts.

  - skills/seo-geo/SKILL.md and agents/seo-geo.md: added Claude-SearchBot,
    corrected the training-crawler versus search-crawler distinction for
    OpenAI and Anthropic, noted that Google-Extended has no effect on Google
    AI Overviews, and added edge/CDN verification guidance.

  - skills/seo-aeo/SKILL.md: the AEO audit produced chat-only output while the
    upstream seo-audit skill persisted a report directory. It now writes
    AEO-REPORT.md and aeo-data.json into the same {domain}-audit/ directory, so
    the SEO and AEO halves compose into one deliverable.

  - Branding, documentation, and plugin manifests.
